    "Content": "<p>PowerShell in Azure Cloud Shell is now generally available.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Manage and deploy resources using PowerShell Core 6 from a secure, web-based Linux environment within Azure.&nbsp;PowerShell in Cloud Shell comes equipped with common tools such as: Azure PowerShell, git, common text editors, and&nbsp;<a href=\"https://na01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fdocs.microsoft.com%2Fazure%2Fcloud-shell%2Ffeatures&amp;data=02%7C01%7C%7C9053c033dc5146c4145b08d615053a82%7C72f988bf86f141af91ab2d7cd011db47%7C1%7C0%7C636719509528929253&amp;sdata=m4lRtGxnb6Xwyub7CW1SgKShieKDfTp19IEq%2FGbF6OA%3D&amp;reserved=0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><u>more</u></a>&nbsp;to help ensure you save time and effort when managing your resources. With faster access from a variety of locations including the&nbsp;<a href=\"https://portal.azure.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><u>Azure portal</u></a>,&nbsp;<a href=\"https://na01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fshell.azure.com%2F&amp;data=02%7C01%7C%7C01c2b7856387411b952908d612c31c4c%7C72f988bf86f141af91ab2d7cd011db47%7C1%7C0%7C636717026522520039&amp;sdata=GXHrvOXO1xZYBdELL0vpiPtz0LvsrwqjTL6SRHmdNrg%3D&amp;reserved=0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><u>shell.azure.com</u></a>,&nbsp;<a href=\"https://na01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fdocs.microsoft.com%2Fpowershell%2Fazure%2Fazureps-vm-tutorial&amp;data=02%7C01%7C%7C01c2b7856387411b952908d612c31c4c%7C72f988bf86f141af91ab2d7cd011db47%7C1%7C0%7C636717026522520039&amp;sdata=q18WxrPHrRWw9dGThaRm8yckW1VGrgLc8Ya9eACd8qI%3D&amp;reserved=0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><u>Microsoft Docs</u></a>,&nbsp;<a href=\"https://na01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmarketplace.visualstudio.com%2Fitems%3FitemName%3Dms-vscode.azure-account&amp;data=02%7C01%7C%7C01c2b7856387411b952908d612c31c4c%7C72f988bf86f141af91ab2d7cd011db47%7C1%7C0%7C636717026522520039&amp;sdata=39XU%2Focox%2FUFT45UdtHkxvc0S6RSU3AaqVvpUoPwyLQ%3D&amp;reserved=0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><u>Visual Studio Code</u></a>, and the&nbsp;<a href=\"https://na01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fazure.microsoft.com%2Ffeatures%2Fazure-portal%2Fmobile-app%2F&amp;data=02%7C01%7C%7C01c2b7856387411b952908d612c31c4c%7C72f988bf86f141af91ab2d7cd011db47%7C1%7C0%7C636717026522520039&amp;sdata=jeVf99kC%2Brx6dAl1SQEv2R%2FhmVpiI8%2BjtuZj43zc5Xk%3D&amp;reserved=0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><u>Azure Mobile App</u></a>, gain access from virtually anywhere.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/powershell/azure/azureps-vm-tutorial?view=azurermps-6.8.1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><u>Learn more</u></a>.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://shell.azure.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><u>Try it now</u></a>.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n",
    "Markdown": "PowerShell in Azure Cloud Shell is now generally available.\n\nManage and deploy resources using PowerShell Core 6 from a secure, web-based Linux environment within Azure. PowerShell in Cloud Shell comes equipped with common tools such as: Azure PowerShell, git, common text editors, and more to help ensure you save time and effort when managing your resources. With faster access from a variety of locations including the Azure portal , shell.azure.com , Microsoft Docs , Visual Studio Code , and the Azure Mobile App , gain access from virtually anywhere.\n\nLearn more .\n\nTry it now ."
  },
